From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:51:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: enable the scaler (test)

TEST-ONLY. Enable ps_msr, ps_msr_ase_core, the scaler DART and the
scaler on the J604 for one test boot. Not for the default kernel.

[j604: re-applied for linux-aurora 1.613: the block is appended after the later tail of
 t8132-j604.dts (sleep, HDMI, boot NOR, ANE), which the original context predates.]

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
index 814ce9a8a8..0ad20390e7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
@@ -1124,3 +1124,20 @@
 &ane {
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+/* TEST-ONLY (j604/k609-scaler-on): the scaler/CSC engine for one dev-loop window. */
+&ps_msr {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_msr_ase_core {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&scaler0_dart {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&scaler0 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
